{
  "name": "从 Google 表格批量抓取企业联系方式 (邮箱、电话、社媒)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Google 表格企业域名联系人挖掘\n\n从 Google 表格读取待查询域名，自动挖掘企业邮箱、电话与社交媒体链接，并将结果写回表格。重复运行仅处理未补全的行。\n\n## 表格所需列\n`domain` · `status` · `emails` · `phones` · `socials` · `enriched_at`\n\n## 配置（仅需一次）\n\n**1. 获取 Apify Token** — https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations\n\n**2. 创建 n8n 凭据**\n凭据 → 新建 → **Header Auth**\n- 名称: `Apify API`\n- Header name: `Authorization`\n- Header value: `Bearer 你的_APIFY_TOKEN`\n\n所有 HTTP 节点均已配置指向该凭据，工作流文件中不包含任何密钥。\n\n## 计费说明\n\n按事件付费：成功找到联系方式（邮箱或电话）的域名每个 $0.006（Gold 阶梯低至 $0.003，千个起价 $3.00）。被拦截、无法访问或无联系信息的域名完全免费。\n\n当前价格详情：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder/pricing\n\nActor 页面：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder\n模板与开源仓库：https://github.com/sumitrmardy/website-contact-finder-api",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "t1-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "t1-read-sheet-manual",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t1-read-sheet",
      "name": "从表格读取域名",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        320,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~website-contact-finder/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ domains: [ $json.domain ] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        }
      },
      "id": "t1-find",
      "name": "查询联系方式 (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(item => {\n  const r = item.json;\n  return {\n    json: {\n      domain: r.domain || '',\n      status: r.status || '',\n      emails: (r.emails || []).map(e => e.email).join(', '),\n      phones: (r.phones || []).map(p => p.e164 || p.raw).join(', '),\n      socials: (r.socials || []).map(s => s.url).join(', '),\n      enriched_at: new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "t1-format",
      "name": "格式化联系人数据",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        }
      },
      "id": "t1-write-sheet",
      "name": "写入联系人至表格",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1040,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "从表格读取域名": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "查询联系方式 (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "查询联系方式 (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "格式化联系人数据",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "格式化联系人数据": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "写入联系人至表格",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "When clicking 'Execute workflow'": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "从表格读取域名",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
